# CODEOWNERS — review ownership
#
# Rules match top-to-bottom; the LAST matching rule wins. This is a solo
# project, so @aaddrick owns everything; the per-area lines below exist for
# discoverability (they make the repo's logical layout visible) and so that
# adding a collaborator later is a one-line change in the right section.
#
# Each listed user must be a repo collaborator with at least read access, or
# GitHub silently ignores them.

# ---- Default: aaddrick owns anything not explicitly claimed ----
*                                       @aaddrick

# ---- Build orchestration ----
/build.sh                               @aaddrick
/scripts/_common.sh                     @aaddrick
/scripts/build-linux.sh                 @aaddrick

# ---- Setup (host detection, dependencies, downloads) ----
/scripts/setup/                         @aaddrick

# ---- App patches ----
/scripts/patches/                       @aaddrick
/scripts/verify-patches.sh              @aaddrick

# ---- Packaging formats + runtime launcher + doctor ----
/scripts/packaging/                     @aaddrick
/scripts/launcher-common.sh             @aaddrick
/scripts/doctor.sh                      @aaddrick

# ---- IPC contract (clean-room Rust helper now lives in its own repo) ----
/docs/reference/                        @aaddrick

# ---- Tests ----
/tests/                                 @aaddrick

# ---- Nix ----
/flake.nix                              @aaddrick
/nix/                                   @aaddrick

# ---- CI / GitHub metadata ----
